<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>San Valentín</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Comic Sans MS', cursive, sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffe6e6;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px;
            position: relative;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ff66b2;
        }
        p {
            color: #ff1a75;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 30px;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #ff66b2;
            border: none;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 32px;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
        .button-no {
            background-color: #ff4d4d;
            position: relative;
        }
        #section2 {
            display: none;
        }
        .heart {
            position: absolute;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            background-color: #ff66b2;
            transform: rotate(45deg);
            animation: float 5s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        .heart::before,
        .heart::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            background-color: #ff66b2;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .heart::before {
            top: -10px;
            left: 0;
        }
        .heart::after {
            left: 10px;
            top: 0;
        }
        @keyframes float {
            0% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0) rotate(45deg);
            }
            50% {
                opacity: 0.5;
                transform: translateY(-200px) rotate(45deg);
            }
            100% {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(-400px) rotate(45deg);
            }
        }
    </style>
    <script>
        function moveButton() {
            var button = document.getElementById('btnNo');
            var x = Math.floor(Math.random() * window.innerWidth);
            var y = Math.floor(Math.random() * window.innerHeight);
            button.style.left = x + 'px';
            button.style.top = y + 'px';
        }

        function showSection() {
            document.getElementById('section1').style.display = 'none';
            document.getElementById('section2').style.display = 'block';
        }

        function createHearts() {
            for (var i = 0; i < 20; i++) {
                var heart = document.createElement('div');
                heart.className = 'heart';
                heart.style.left = Math.random() * 100 + 'vw';
                heart.style.animationDuration = 3 + Math.random() * 2 + 's';
                document.body.appendChild(heart);
            }
        }

        window.onload = createHearts;
    </script>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="section1" class="container">
        <a href="https://imgbb.com/"><img src="https://i.ibb.co/0jmymS8k/bear.gif" alt="bear" border="0"></a>
        <h1>¿Quieres ser mi Valentín?</h1>
        <p>&lt;😏😏</p>
        <button class="button" onclick="showSection()">Sí</button>
        <button class="button button-no" id="btnNo" onmouseover="moveButton()">No</button>
    </div>
    <div id="section2" class="container">
        <h1>mibebe</h1>
        <p>Es extraño como llegué a enamorarme tanto de ti, me encanta pasar mi tiempo contigo aún así a veces sea poco, aunque no tengo mucho intenté hacer algo decente, me siento mal porque no puedo irte a ver en un día especial, porque no puedo darte cosas ☹️. </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
